# NODISK.SCR - INVTEST's crit run on MS-DOS 3.10 (MAKEFILE): a mailbox on
# drive B:, which has no disk, so the post's first call raises a critical
# error.  INVTEST's handler fails that call, and the post fails with the
# DOS error instead of an "Abort, Retry, Ignore?" prompt.
@MBOX 1 MB1 B:
>& HELLO
@POST 1
